Use:

### Backend

* Python
* Flask
* Flask-SQLAlchemy
* Marshmallow
* Flask-JWT-Extended

### Frontend

* React
* React Router
* React Hook Form
* Axios

### File Storage

* Local storage for development
* AWS S3-compatible architecture for production readiness

